            </span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-[2px] bg-stone-400 dark:bg-stone-600 inline-block"></span>2020–21</span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-[2px] bg-brand-light dark:bg-brand-dark inline-block"></span>2030–31E</span>
            </div>
